{"author": "sjm41", "body": "* **Rule (ID and label):**\nRU361159\n\n* **Sequences with problematic annotation (ID + gene/protein name):**\nO76895 (D. melanogaster Arg, FBgn0023535)\n\n* **Description of issue**\n RU361159 add UniPathway:UPA00158, which then generates a GO annotation of 'urea cycle' (GO:0000050).\nBut insects don't have a urea cycle (the GO term recently had a taxon constraint added to address this).\n\n@rozaru ", "created_at": "2026-03-31T06:43:23Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["UniRule"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": " UniRule issue: RU361159", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-04-16T09:46:22Z"}
